Maintainer: The package maintainer <judgelor@umich.edu>
Description: A suite of functions to detect U.S. legislator names in messy text with typos and inconsistent name formats.
    Example data from the Congressional Record and congressional letters to the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission are provided.
